# 1. Try to copy a non-existent file (shows error)
cp notes.txt

# 2. Copy homework.txt to backup.txt
cp homework.txt backup.txt

# 3. View contents of backup.txt
cat backup.txt

# 4. Check file type of 'draft' (doesn't exist - error)
file draft

# 5. Check file type of grades.txt
file grades.txt

# 6. Check file type of backup.txt
file backup.txt

# 7. Find grades.txt
find grades.txt

# 8. Open grades.txt in nano editor (ADD CONTENT HERE)
nano grades.txt
# Type multiple lines like:
